      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِطِّيسٌ</span></b>  <i>A great hammer,</i> (S, M, A, O, K,) <i>such
as is used by a blacksmith:</i> (A, TA:) or, (K,)
accord. to IDrd, (O,) it is either Greek or Syriac,
(O, K,) not genuine Arabic. (O.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <i>A
